# Atlas Core High-Performance Component Tokens (v1.0.0)
**Author:** Onyx Okafor  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D13 10:25  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Ultra-low-latency design token architecture for Atlas Core, compiled for zero-runtime CSS resolution and instant AST parsing, directly calibrated against the brand and accessibility standards in Company Document.

